  "body": "## Summary\nDecision record for #5814 (follow-on of #5674). Settles the conformance harness shape, the golden-vector and property-test oracles, the generated interop matrix with a smoke subset in the merge gate and the full matrix nightly, and the invariants implementation must hold. Lists rejected alternatives and open points with defaults.\n\nRefs #5814. Parent #5674. Epic #2056.\n\n## Evidence\n- Design only; nothing built or run.\n- `pkgs/id/test-vectors` exists on `origin/main` (3273155a115).\n\n## Merge Danger\nNone. Adds one doc file under `doc/decisions/`.\n\n<!-- pm-metadata:start -->\n```json\n{\n  \"direct_parent\": null,\n  \"links\": [],\n  \"lineage\": {\n    \"design\": null,\n    \"roadmap_item\": null,\n    \"priority\": null\n  },\n  \"pm_meta\": 1,\n  \"provenance\": {\n    \"queue_id\": null,\n    \"scheduled_start\": null,\n    \"picked_up_at\": null,\n    \"work_started_at\": null,\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-11-23T21:05:30Z\",\n    \"session_id\": \"ses_e5df5dcdb54ffeB5ILytTFUCSM\",\n    \"lane\": null,\n    \"host\": \"amd\",\n    \"worktree\": \"/home/user/git/code-worktrees/code-j-5814\",\n    \"model\": null,\n    \"lane_start_issues\": [],\n    \"workspace_ref\": {\n      \"kind\": \"worktree\",\n      \"id\": \"/home/user/git/code-worktrees/code-j-5814\",\n      \"repo\": \"developing-today/code\",\n      \"branch\": \"code-j/5814-conformance-design\",\n      \"sha\": \"82444b0298cba527b4bdf3bb8c887ce44c98a482\"\n    },\n    \"auth_subject\": \"oc-code-01\",\n    \"stamped_by\": \"fleet 0.1.0 (native)\"\n  }\n}\n```\n<!-- pm-metadata:end -->\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://dashboardbackend.blacksmith.sh/track/run-proof?expires=1798059936&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=13734&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F13734&variant=get_evidence&signature=27e2496dce9c77665d46f1535ee4c5de521069c51906f822f3f01e5f3e5c3d